          "jcr:created": "Thu Jan 18 2024 17:29:28 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Emergency care <span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">reimagined</span></span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Stryker is your partner in next-gen nursing</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Emergency nurses like you face the unpredictable every day, delivering care when it matters most. As the pace and complexity of care evolve, the tools behind it must advance too. That's why we're reimagining emergency care, from the roadside to the SmartED. In partnership with nurses like you, we're driving innovation that connects teams and advances care.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Jul 21 2026 15:58:23 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
